==English==

===Etymology===
[[calque|Calque]] of German ''[[Gummibärchen]]'', the name of the confectionery in Germany.

===Proper noun===
[[Image:Gummy bears.jpg|thumb|Gummy Bears]]
{{head|en|proper noun|g=p}}

# {{context|trademark}} A kind of [[gummy]] [[candy]], a type of [[confectionery]] made from [[gelatine]], in the miniature form of a toy [[bear]].

====Usage notes====
This term is a registered trademark <!--FERRARA PAN CANDY CO., INC., reg no 1386950 --> in the United States for the candy and for toys, with different trademark holders.

